# Coupon Feature Implementation Plan

Add a phone-number-based coupon system to the Checkout screen. Coupons are created by admin via the website panel and are tied to a specific phone number with a one-time use.

## Database Schema (Already Created)

Table: `public.coupons`
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| [id](file:///c:/neatify/neatify-v2/Appv2_updated-main/src/context/NotificationContext.tsx#50-54) | UUID | Primary Key |
| `coupon_code` | TEXT | Unique code e.g. "WELCOME20" |
| `phone_number` | TEXT | 10-digit phone number |
| `discount_percentage` | NUMERIC | 0–100 |
| `is_used` | BOOLEAN | Default: false |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Auto |

RLS Policies already applied (anon can SELECT and UPDATE is_used only).

---

## Proposed Changes

### [CheckoutScreen.tsx](file:///c:/neatify/neatify-v2/Appv2_updated-main/src/screens/CheckoutScreen.tsx)

#### Step 1 — Add Coupon State Variables
Add these state variables near the top of the component (after existing state declarations ~line 120):

```typescript
// Coupon state
const [coupon, setCoupon] = useState<{ id: string; coupon_code: string; discount_percentage: number } | null>(null);
const [couponApplied, setCouponApplied] = useState(false);
const [couponDiscount, setCouponDiscount] = useState(0);
```

---

#### Step 2 — Fetch Coupon for User's Phone (inside [loadProfile](file:///c:/neatify/neatify-v2/Appv2_updated-main/src/screens/CheckoutScreen.tsx#183-260) function)
After the profile is loaded and `cleanedProfile` is set (~line 208), add a coupon check:

```typescript
// ✅ Check for coupon linked to this phone number
const userPhone = formatDisplayPhone(profileData.phone); // 10-digit
const { data: couponData } = await supabase
  .from("coupons")
  .select("id, coupon_code, discount_percentage")
  .eq("phone_number", userPhone)
  .eq("is_used", false)
  .maybeSingle();

if (couponData) {
  setCoupon(couponData);
}
```

> [!NOTE]
> The phone number in `coupons` table must be stored as a 10-digit number (no country code). The [formatDisplayPhone()](file:///c:/neatify/neatify-v2/Appv2_updated-main/src/screens/ProfileScreen.tsx#605-616) helper already clean to 10-digits.

---

#### Step 3 — Update `grandTotal` Calculation to Apply Coupon Discount
Replace the existing `grandTotal` useMemo (~line 358):

```typescript
// OLD:
const grandTotal = useMemo(() => totalPrice + totalTax, [totalPrice, totalTax]);

// NEW:
const grandTotal = useMemo(() => {
  const baseTotal = totalPrice + totalTax;
  if (couponApplied && couponDiscount > 0) {
    const discountAmount = (baseTotal * couponDiscount) / 100;
    return baseTotal - discountAmount;
  }
  return baseTotal;
}, [totalPrice, totalTax, couponApplied, couponDiscount]);
```

---

#### Step 4 — Add `applyCoupon` handler function
Add this function after [fetchCurrentLocation](file:///c:/neatify/neatify-v2/Appv2_updated-main/src/screens/CheckoutScreen.tsx#277-308) (~line 307):

```typescript
const applyCoupon = () => {
  if (!coupon) return;
  setCouponDiscount(coupon.discount_percentage);
  setCouponApplied(true);
};
```

---

#### Step 5 — Mark Coupon as `is_used = true` After Payment Success
Inside [handlePlaceOrder](file:///c:/neatify/neatify-v2/Appv2_updated-main/src/screens/CheckoutScreen.tsx#365-585), after the booking is marked as `"paid"` (~line 544), add:

```typescript
// ✅ Mark coupon as used (if applied)
if (couponApplied && coupon) {
  await supabase
    .from("coupons")
    .update({ is_used: true })
    .eq("id", coupon.id);
  console.log("✅ Coupon marked as used:", coupon.coupon_code);
}
```

---

#### Step 6 — Add Coupon Card UI in the Order Summary section
Insert this block **between the Order Summary card and the Address section** (~after line 670, before the Address `<Text>` heading):

```tsx
{/* ✅ COUPON CARD - Only shown if user has an active coupon */}
{coupon && (
  <View style={styles.couponCard}>
    <Text style={styles.couponTitle}>🎉 You have a coupon!</Text>
    <View style={styles.couponRow}>
      <View style={styles.couponCodeBox}>
        <Text style={styles.couponCode}>{coupon.coupon_code}</Text>
      </View>
      {couponApplied ? (
        <View style={styles.couponAppliedBadge}>
          <Text style={styles.couponAppliedText}>✅ Applied! {coupon.discount_percentage}% off</Text>
        </View>
      ) : (
        <Pressable style={styles.couponApplyBtn} onPress={applyCoupon}>
          <Text style={styles.couponApplyBtnText}>Apply</Text>
        </Pressable>
      )}
    </View>
    {couponApplied && (
      <Text style={styles.couponSavingText}>
        You save ₹{((totalPrice + totalTax) * coupon.discount_percentage / 100).toFixed(2)} with this coupon!
      </Text>
    )}
  </View>
)}
```

